52d|n|The act of arriving, or coming; the act of reaching a place from a distance, whether by water (as in its original sense) or by land. ; The attainment or reaching of any object, by effort, or in natural course; as, our arrival at this conclusion was wholly unexpected. ; The person or thing arriving or which has arrived; as, news brought by the last arrival. ; An approach.	a:1u08,56,4~1u08,56,4	n:2don,75,12;1px,32,7;17cm,32,3~2don,75,12;1px,32,7;17cm,32,3	N:29co,46,4~29co,46,4
